msgctxt "460"
msgid "Hey pal, ask me anything you want about darts."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "472"
msgid "Yeah? Well just let me know if you do."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "484"
msgid "What do you want to know about awards?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "496"
msgid "Simply put, awards are proof of how well you play."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "508"
msgid ""
"You receive an award once you achieve results above a certain level during "
"a game."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "520"
msgid "You'll be seen as a decent darts player once you've won several awards."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "532"
msgid ""
"The results screen at the end of each game will show which awards you won "
"and how many times you won them for that game."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "544"
msgid "There are many kinds of awards. Which one would you like to know about?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "556"
msgid ""
"Low Ton is an award for scoring between 101 and 150 points in a single "
"round."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "568"
msgid ""
"However, please note that getting a hat trick or three in the black will "
"not result in getting a low ton."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "580"
msgid ""
"The Low Ton award is available in the '01 Game and Count-Up, so make sure "
"to go for it when playing them. Good luck!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "592"
msgid ""
"High Ton is an award for scoring between 151 and 180 points in a single "
"round."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "604"
msgid ""
"This award is available in the '01 Game and Count-Up. You're a force to be "
"reckoned with if you're able to snag this award!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "616"
msgid ""
"Hat Trick is an award for hitting the bull's-eye with all three throws in "
"one round."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "628"
msgid ""
"This award is available in all three game types ('01 Game, Cricket, and "
"Count-Up), so try to earn it if you can!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "640"
msgid "Three in a Bed is kind of a complicated award. Its name's pretty long, too."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "652"
msgid ""
"This award is for hitting the same number in the double ring with all three "
"throws or the triple ring with all three throws in one round."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "664"
msgid ""
"This award is available in all three game types ('01 Game, Cricket, and "
"Count-Up). You're an amazing player if you can get it!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "676"
msgid "White Horse is an award that's only available in Cricket. Don't forget!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "688"
msgid ""
"It's awarded for hitting different cricket numbers in the triple ring with "
"all three throws in one round."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "700"
msgid ""
"Oh, and did I mention that the cricket numbers are 15 to 20 and the "
"bull's-eye?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "712"
msgid ""
"Ton 80 is an award for hitting 20 in the triple ring with all three throws "
"in one round."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "724"
msgid ""
"This award is available in all three game types ('01 Game, Cricket, and "
"Count-Up), so try to earn it if you can!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "736"
msgid "Three in the Black is an advanced version of the Hat Trick award."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "748"
msgid ""
"It's awarded for hitting different double bull's-eye with all three throws "
"in one round."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "760"
msgid ""
"This award is available in all three game types ('01 Game, Cricket, and "
"Count-Up), so try to earn it if you can!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "772"
msgid "What do you want to know about the Darts Live Membership Card?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "784"
msgid ""
"This bar knows how to treat its customers well, so it gives a free Darts "
"Live Membership Card to customers playing for the first time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "796"
msgid ""
"The card records your name and your results in the '01 Game, Cricket, and "
"Count-Up, as well as your overall rank for all three."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "808"
msgid ""
"Cards can record all sorts of information. What would you like to hear "
"about?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "820"
msgid ""
"Simply put, stats are your average scores. The higher the number, the "
"better you are as a player."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "832"
msgid "Your card will record your stats for the '01 Game and Cricket."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "844"
msgid ""
"For Count-Up, the previous high score is recorded on your card, so try to "
"break it!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "856"
msgid ""
"Your rating takes into account your overall stats for the '01 Game and "
"Cricket, rating you on a scale between 1 and 18."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "868"
msgid "The highest rating is 18, so work hard, and you just might snag it!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "880"
msgid ""
"A flight is like a division. There are six flights, each named with "
"letters: C, CC, B, BB, A, and AA."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "892"
msgid "The highest flight is AA, but you probably already figured that out."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "904"
msgid "Tell me about awards."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "916"
